ready: 1
kind: entity_group
id: capture.data
module: capture
title: Capture data
summary: Raw captures, transcript events, and the cursors that make ingestion idempotent.
entities:
  - capture.data.raw-entry
  - capture.data.event
  - capture.data.ingest-cursor
rationale: >-
  Events and their cursor commit together so hooks, catch-up, and history import can all trigger
  the same file and each record still becomes exactly one event. Raw captures and events both
  carry their own expiry, fixed when they are stored, so later processing never extends how long
  raw content is kept.
